This package depends on, but does not include, anthropics/zeta-23-lean
("Zeta23"), Copyright 2026 Anthropic, PBC, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, fetched by the build tool from its public repository at the
revision pinned in lake-manifest.json
(3635e74826a4c1fcece7d1cd2b6fa75e43a00510). Every counting function, analytic
input, window calculus and linear-algebra fact this development consumes comes
from there by import; none of it is copied into this repository.

One file adapts code from that dependency rather than merely importing it:

  Zeta23Ext/Bridge/Helpers_S8.lean
    transcribes Zeta23.Assembly.seamA_mult2 (Zeta23/Assembly/SeamMult.lean) and
    Zeta23.ThmD.thmD_mult2_abstract (Zeta23/ThmD/Mult.lean), Copyright (c) 2026
    Anthropic, PBC, Apache License, Version 2.0, carrying one extra nonnegative
    real through every inequality. The proof bodies are theirs and remain under
    their licence; the changes, marked `-- [S8]`, are this laboratory's. The
    file carries the same notice in its header.

This package also depends on, but does not include, Lean 4
(https://github.com/leanprover/lean4) and mathlib4 with its standard dependency
set, at the revisions pinned in lake-manifest.json.
